380"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\rm sw}\">\\(\\le_{\\rm sw}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8cae575293a2fb87\" href=\"?note=8cae575293a2fb87\" title=\"43-df-sw-red\">43-df-sw-red</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:2^\\omega\\to[0,1]\">\\(v:2^\\omega\\to[0,1]\\)</span> 由下式定义。下式所有sw比较均直接作用于给出的展开序列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v(X)\\coloneqq\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\qquad(X\\in2^\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v(X)\\coloneqq\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\qquad(X\\in2^\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(X))\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(Y))\\land\\forall Z\\in2^\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(Z))\\Rightarrow\\neg(X\\le_{\\rm sw}Z\\land Y\\le_{\\rm sw}Z))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(X))\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(Y))\\land\\forall Z\\in2^\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(Z))\\Rightarrow\\neg(X\\le_{\\rm sw}Z\\land Y\\le_{\\rm sw}Z))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此为不存在sw完全左c.e.实数的更强双见证形式：某一固定对没有共同的左c.e.sw上界。归约中的各常数均可不同。源书给出Yu–Ding过程及Barmpalias–Lewis验证；核对陈述与量词，未独立重证整个攻击区间构造。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 13.6.1 and Corollary 13.6.2 (Yu–Ding)；印刷页357–360，PDF页377–380。本轮逐项核对来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-sw-red","status":"resolved","id":"8cae575293a2fb87","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-sw-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$、$\\le_{\\rm sw}$ 见 [[43-df-leftcomputable]]、[[43-df-sw-red]]；$v:2^\\omega\\to[0,1]$ 由下式定义。下式所有sw比较均直接作用于给出的展开序列。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-sw-red","status":"resolved","id":"8cae575293a2fb87","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$、$\\le_{\\rm sw}$ 见 [[43-df-leftcomputable]]、[[43-df-sw-red]]；$v:2^\\omega\\to[0,1]$ 由下式定义。下式所有sw比较均直接作用于给出的展开序列。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_{\\rm sw}","display":false},{"tex":"v:2^\\omega\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"v(X)\\coloneqq\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\qquad(X\\in2^\\omega).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(X))\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(Y))\\land\\forall Z\\in2^\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}